<title>SINGAPORE: G.K.Goh 1st half net profit falls 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>G.K.Goh 1st half net profit falls 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     8.93  vs   9.08</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)			    2.7   vs   2.7</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)	  2.2   vs   2.3</p>
<p>    Turnover					40.47  vs  46.50</p>
<p>    Investment income			    0.49  vs   0.23</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest		4.35  vs   3.25</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)			   1.09  vs   1.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		     1.42  vs   1.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				 9.68  vs  12.59</p>
<p>    Profits from associates		    2.88  vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Tax						3.77  vs   4.57</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)			    0.14  vs   0.05</p>
<p>Note - G.K.Goh Holdings Ltd is a stock brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
